<section id="platforms" class="panel reveal delay-3">
  <p class="eyebrow">Production Proofs & Testbeds</p>
  <h2 style="margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3.2vw, 2.4rem);">Engineering Assets & Proving Grounds</h2>
  <p class="lead" style="margin-top: 0.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.6rem;">
    We don't just theorize architecture—we build, ship, and test it under real operating pressures. These internal software assets demonstrate full-stack execution and serve as proving grounds within the broader Gibson family of operating companies (Gibson Holding Company roadmap).
  </p>

  <div class="grid">
    <article class="card">
      <p class="eyebrow">Architectural Proof of Execution</p>
      <h3>Divergent Flow (Live Testbed)</h3>
      <p>
        A live, deployed production testbed demonstrating full-stack architecture: a responsive, reactive React front end paired with a modern .NET / event-driven microservices back end. Serves as an architectural proving ground for decoupled domain events, reactive state workflows, and candidate client integration for the Divergent platform.
      </p>
      <div class="badge-row">
        <span class="badge">React & TypeScript</span>
        <span class="badge">Modern .NET Back End</span>
        <span class="badge">Event-Driven CQRS</span>
      </div>
      <a class="button ghost" style="margin-top: 1rem;" href="https://getdivergentflow.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Inspect Live Architecture ↗</a>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <p class="eyebrow">Operational Testbed</p>
      <h3>Shop Workflow & Field Proving Ground</h3>
      <p>
        A domain-driven 3-entity workflow utility (Jobs, Customers, Equipment) tested under live commercial shop conditions at Gibson Service Company to validate mobile usability, offline synchronization, and resilient operational data flows.
      </p>
      <div class="badge-row">
        <span class="badge">Kanban State Machine</span>
        <span class="badge">Field Operations</span>
        <span class="badge">Domain-Driven Design</span>
      </div>
      <a class="button ghost" style="margin-top: 1rem;" href="mailto:jgsteeler@gmail.com?subject=Shop%20App%20POC%20Inquiry">Request POC Overview</a>
    </article>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 1.4rem; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color); font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--text-dim); font-style: italic;">
    * Note: Gibson Tech Works is focused exclusively on enterprise consulting, audit readiness, and fractional architectural advisory. Software testbeds and internal tooling represent technology assets within the broader Gibson family of operating companies (Gibson Holding Company roadmap).
  </div>
</section>
